      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{用数学归纳法证明数列}\\{x_{n}\\} \\text{单调增加且有上界,显然}x_{2}-x_{1}&gt;0, \\text{假定}x_{k+1}-x_{k}&gt;0,\\\\&amp;\\text{由}x_{k+2}-x_{k+1}=\\frac{x_{k+1}-x_{k}}{\\sqrt{c+x_{k+1}}+\\sqrt{c+x_{k}}}\\text{可知}x_{k+2}-x_{k+1}&gt;0, \\text{故该数列单调增加.}\\\\&amp;\\text{显然}x_{1}&lt;\\sqrt{c}+1, \\text{假定}x_{k}&lt;\\sqrt{c}+1, \\text{则}x_{k+1}&lt;\\sqrt{c+\\sqrt{c+1}}&lt;\\sqrt{\\left(\\sqrt{c}+1\\right)^{2}}=\\sqrt{c}+1.\\\\&amp;\\text{于是该数列有上界.由单调有界原理知}\\lim_{n\\rightarrow\\infty}x_{n}\\text{存在,设为}a. \\text{在迭代公式两端取极限得到}a=\\sqrt{c+a}. \\text{解此方程得到}a=\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1+4c}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{用数学归纳法证明数列}\\{x_{n}\\} \\text{单调增加且有上界,显然}x_{2}-x_{1}&gt;0, \\text{假定}x_{k+1}-x_{k}&gt;0,\\\\&amp;\\text{由}x_{k+2}-x_{k+1}=\\frac{x_{k+1}-x_{k}}{\\sqrt{c+x_{k+1}}+\\sqrt{c+x_{k}}}\\text{可知}x_{k+2}-x_{k+1}&gt;0, \\text{故该数列单调增加.}\\\\&amp;\\text{显然}x_{1}&lt;\\sqrt{c}+1, \\text{假定}x_{k}&lt;\\sqrt{c}+1, \\text{则}x_{k+1}&lt;\\sqrt{c+\\sqrt{c+1}}&lt;\\sqrt{\\left(\\sqrt{c}+1\\right)^{2}}=\\sqrt{c}+1.\\\\&amp;\\text{于是该数列有上界.由单调有界原理知}\\lim_{n\\rightarrow\\infty}x_{n}\\text{存在,设为}a. \\text{在迭代公式两端取极限得到}a=\\sqrt{c+a}. \\text{解此方程得到}a=\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1+4c}}{2}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
