      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+n!}{n!}=1+\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-1)!}{n!}, \\text{㊺}\\\\&amp;\\text{由于}\\text{㊺}\\\\&amp;0&lt;\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-1)!}{n!}=\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-2)!+(n-1)!}{n!}\\\\&amp;&lt;\\frac{(n-2)(n-2)!+(n-1)!}{n!}&lt;\\frac{2(n-1)!}{n!}=\\frac{2}{n},\\\\&amp;\\text{而且}\\frac{2}{n}\\to 0,\\ \\text{所以由夹逼准则得}\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-1)!}{n!}=0,\\ \\text{故}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+n!}{n!}=1+\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-1)!}{n!}, \\text{㊺}\\\\&amp;\\text{由于}\\text{㊺}\\\\&amp;0&lt;\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-1)!}{n!}=\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-2)!+(n-1)!}{n!}\\\\&amp;&lt;\\frac{(n-2)(n-2)!+(n-1)!}{n!}&lt;\\frac{2(n-1)!}{n!}=\\frac{2}{n},\\\\&amp;\\text{而且}\\frac{2}{n}\\to 0,\\ \\text{所以由夹逼准则得}\\frac{1!+2!+\\ldots+(n-1)!}{n!}=0,\\ \\text{故}\\end{aligned}</div>"
